# Everything the build context does not need.
#
# node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes and would be re-sent to the daemon on every
# build, then discarded — the image installs its own from the lockfile. A large context is
# also why a "cached" build still takes thirty seconds.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/release
desktop/dist
web/dist
services/bin

# Never let a local secret reach a build context, from which it can end up in a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
polaris.env

# Not needed to build, and large.
docs
backups
playwright-report
test-results
coverage
**/*.md
!README.md
